  accTitle: Fixture: checkout session states
  accDescr: State diagram: Fixture: checkout session states. 4 states: not_ready_for_payment, ready for payment x, completed, and canceled. Starts in not_ready_for_payment. Ends in completed and canceled. 4 transitions. From not_ready_for_payment to ready for payment x when POST /checkout_sessions/ id: buyer details added (POST /checkout_sessions/ id ). From ready for payment x to completed when complete payment token accepted. From ready for payment x to canceled when cancel. From not_ready_for_payment to canceled when end.
  state "not_ready_for_payment" as s_not_ready
  state "ready #quot;for#quot; payment #123;x#125;" as s_ready
  state "completed" as s_completed
  state "canceled" as s_canceled
  [*] --> s_not_ready
  s_not_ready --> s_ready : POST /checkout_sessions/#123;id#125;: buyer details added
  s_ready --> s_completed : complete#59; payment token accepted
  s_ready --> s_canceled : cancel
  s_not_ready --> s_canceled : end​
  s_completed --> [*]
  s_canceled --> [*]
  note right of s_completed : Order created#58; id returned#59; done
